				Christian writer of the early part of the third century</i>,
			A.D., <i><span class="en">Hier. Ep. 100</span></i>; Aug. Civ. Dei,
			21, 17.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ōrĭgĕnistes</span></b> ,
